#News Event Pics GFX

#Index; Search for these names using CTRL+F and you'll find the section they entitle.
#Subfolders of each section are ordered alphabetically
#Event Pics names should be in format "GFX_news_event_TAG_name" with some exceptions for generic and global events
#	a) Generic
#	b) Global
#	c) Proxy Wars
#	d) Africa
#	e) Asia
#	f) LATAM
#	g) OFN
#	h) Reich
#	i) Russia
#	j) Triumvirate
#	k) Zombie

